WEBVTT

00:28:26.704 --> 00:28:30.621
or 30 years when people who are just
starting out their career become CEOs.

00:28:30.996 --> 00:28:34.621
Does that mean we're going to see more
servant leaders, more givers than takers?

00:28:34.913 --> 00:28:37.663
I would certainly hope so, based
on what we've seen in the past.

00:28:39.913 --> 00:28:42.121
There are some reasons for
optimism in the long run,

00:28:42.746 --> 00:28:46.246
the chaos we live through can make
people stronger and better in

00:28:46.246 --> 00:28:47.246
a very real way

00:28:47.704 --> 00:28:48.788
in terms of how they mitigate

00:28:48.788 --> 00:28:51.704
the uncertainty associated
with bad economic times.

00:28:52.496 --> 00:28:57.288
One, I think very positive way is through
connecting with other people.

00:28:57.663 --> 00:29:01.996
This tendency for connectivity brings us
to one last surprise from Emily's studies.